
# 0x Swap API key (https://0x.org/docs/introduction/getting-started) — used
# by the Wallet tab's price/quote lookups. This is a client-side app with no
# backend, so this key ships in the built JS bundle and is visible to anyone
# who opens devtools. Only use a key that's fine to expose (a rate-limited
# personal quoting key, not shared with anything else) — it cannot move funds
# on its own; MetaMask's own confirmation is what authorizes any transaction.
VITE_ZEROX_API_KEY=

# No WalletConnect/Reown project ID needed — the Wallet tab connects via
# MetaMask's own "MetaMask Connect" SDK, which auto-detects the right method
# (browser extension, its own QR code, or a mobile deeplink) with zero config.
